    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "David Ross Estate Agents, your local property experts, are delighted to present No.53 Ballyfermot Crescent. This 2 bed 1 bath property located in the heart of Ballyfermot is sure to catch the eye of any discerning purchaser.\r\n\r\nNumber 53 benefits from fantastic local amenities. The property is only a couple of minutes stroll from several shops and cafes on the Ballyfermot main road. There are parks, sports facilities, primary and secondary schools as well as a modern leisure centre also nearby.\r\n\r\nUpon entering the property you are met with a small entrance hallway, a cosy front living room is just off this. Moving through the property you have a larger living room, a great space for relaxing or entertaining. Towards the rear you will find a modern extended kitchen which completes the ground floor.\r\n\r\nTo the rear you have a large and sunny back garden, a great space to spend those long summer days.\r\n\r\nMoving upstairs you have a double bedroom to the rear, another double bedroom to the front alongside a fully tiled family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThis area benefits from great public transport links with several bus routes running through the area making your commute to and from the City Centre as easy as possible.\r\n\r\nThis property will be very popular so early viewing would be recommended.\r\nViewing by appointment only.\r\n\r\nKey features:\r\n\r\n- Large back garden\r\n- Turn key condition\r\n- Extended to the rear\r\n- Local amenities\r\n- Public transport links"
      },
      {
